<p>I put the words &quot;mushroom&quot; and &quot;village&quot; together and now all I can think of is Super Mario Bros. Which is a shame, because this is very good. I particularly enjoyed just how misleading the containment procedures are. As I read through them, I was thinking, &quot;Oh, it's some kind of tree or something&quot;, and then the description begins, &quot;This is a village&quot; and that kind of blew my mind.</p>
<p>Two suggestions: black out the names rather than expunging them, and read back through this for phrasal repetitions. Though I see it was a 24-hour challenge, so you did quite well in that regard.</p>

